# A Michaelis-Menten rule whose kcat and Km are changed by an RNF script.
#
# MMRxnClass held kcat and Km as the numbers read at load, with no record of
# the parameters they came from, so "set kcat 4", "set Km 100" and "update"
# changed the parameters and left the rule at kcat = 1 and Km = 1000.
#
# 1000 S and 50 E. At kcat = 1 and Km = 1000, Ptot at t = 4 is about 96; with
# kcat = 4 and Km = 100 set after one time unit it is 542.5 +/- 1.5 (network
# SSA on BioNetGen 2.9.3 with setParameter, 200 seeds).
begin model
begin parameters
  kcat 1
  Km   1000
end parameters
begin molecule types
  E()
  S()
  P()
end molecule types
begin seed species
  E() 50
  S() 1000
end seed species
begin observables
  Molecules Ptot P()
end observables
begin reaction rules
  S() + E() -> P() + E() MM(kcat,Km)
end reaction rules
end model
begin actions
writeXML()
end actions
